# OxyOS target-runtime manifest: the Debian base the native platform runs on.
# There is no graphical session yet. Do not add a display server, compositor,
# greeter, browser shell or desktop application here: none of them run on the
# OxyOS display protocol, and scripts/check-image-config.py rejects them.

